%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-filterobject (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{"letter1": "a", "letter2": "b", "id": 1} filterObject ((value, key) -> key startsWith "letter")
%%% output application/json
{
  "letter1": "a",
  "letter2": "b"
}
